# Claude Code profiles: two accounts, one shared configuration

Never set `CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/.claude`, and never write a bare `~` in it: both silently start an empty third profile. Invoke `claude-profile-safety` before starting a session under another account, before editing or linking shared global configuration, and when MCP tools or an identity are missing for reasons that are not obvious.
